const APPRAISAL_TEXT_CONTROL=`Appraisal text has two independent slot kinds: affinity.appraisal is the first impression, affinity.current_appraisal is the current evaluation. Use the exact requested slot and target. Do not combine both into one text or return first/current labels inside the text. First impression: only fill a missing/empty record during an actual conversation, using visible appearance, the owner's established personality/values and the resulting feeling; never rewrite a nonempty first impression. Current evaluation: write the owner's present judgment, its evidence and resulting feeling; use actual dialogue, behavior, observed appearance and facts the owner learned, and update only when new evidence supports a change or clarification. A changed opinion belongs only in current evaluation. No taste/affinity metric changes are authorized by writing either text. Existing first impressions and the other target's records are read-only context.`;

